@host = http://localhost:5053

### Inserir
POST {{host}}/api/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Souza",
  "email": "joao@aluno.uniaraxa.edu.br"
}

### Listar todos
GET {{host}}/api/student

### Buscar por id
GET {{host}}/api/student/1

### Atualizar
PUT {{host}}/api/student/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Souza Lima",
  "email": "joao@aluno.uniaraxa.edu.br"
}

### Remover
DELETE {{host}}/api/student/1
